From: Pan Zapalka <jarek@slopkernel.local>
Subject: [PATCH] leds: qti-flash: Fix incorrect switch brightness function name

Fix compilation error caused by calling non-existent function
'qti_flash_led_switch_brightness_set'. The correct function name
is 'qti_flash_switch_brightness_set'.

--- a/drivers/leds/leds-qti-flash.c
+++ b/drivers/leds/leds-qti-flash.c
@@ -623,7 +623,7 @@ ssize_t qti_flash_store(const char *buf, size_t count)
 	for (i = 0; i < led->num_snodes; i++) {
 		if (led->snode[i].cdev.name && 
 			!strcmp("led:switch_0", led->snode[i].cdev.name)) {
-			qti_flash_led_switch_brightness_set(&led->snode[i].cdev, curr);
+			qti_flash_switch_brightness_set(&led->snode[i].cdev, curr);
 			break;
 		}
 	}
